nix:82:5"],"declarations":["/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/perSystem.nix"],"defaultText":null,"description":"A function that pre-processes flake inputs.\n\nIt is called for users of `perSystem` such that `inputs'.${name} = config.perInput system inputs.${name}`.\n\nThis is used for [`inputs'`](../module-arguments.html#inputs) and [`self'`](../module-arguments.html#self).\n\nThe attributes returned by the `perInput` function definitions are merged into a single namespace (per input), \nso each module should return an attribute set with usually only one or two predictable attribute names. Otherwise,\nthe `inputs'` namespace gets polluted.\n","hasDefault":false,"hasDefaultText":false,"internal":false,"readOnly":false,"visible":true},"path":["perInput"],"type":6,"values":{}},{"error":false,"metadata":{"declarationPositions":["/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/withSystem.nix:13:5","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/perSystem.nix:97:5","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/lib.nix:246:9","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/lib.nix:246:9","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/formatter.nix:53:5","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/lib.nix:246:9","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/debug.nix:52:5","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/lib.nix:246:9","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/lib.nix:246:9"],"declarations":["/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/withSystem.nix","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/perSystem.nix","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/packages.nix","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/legacyPackages.nix","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/formatter.nix","/nix/store/6xr58mfvs42ixw6428x3vm9l5h88l2z7-source/modules/devShells.nix","/nix/store/6xr